            0.109
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Is a rectangle a parallelogram?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.111,
            0.849,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A rectangle has opposite sides parallel. So, it satisfies the parallelogram’s definition. Hence, it is indeed a parallelogram. More specifically, a rectangle is a special kind of parallelogram with all its angles equal to 90°."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.185,
            0.682,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us represent this relation using a Venn diagram."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.215,
            0.732,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "chart_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.267,
                0.215,
                0.732,
                0.413
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_14_chart_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.431,
            0.848,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To understand the relations between the sides and the angles of a parallelogram, let us construct the following figure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.507,
            0.515,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Draw a parallelogram with adjacent sides of lengths 4 cm and 5 cm, and an angle of 30° between them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.311,
            0.571,
            0.378,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
